# 中文说明：开发集单点验证，不积分、不改变原始周期边界。
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
read_data minimized.data
pair_style pace
pair_coeff * * /workspace/potential-comparison/rebuilt/ACE_energy100/AgCSiTi.yace Ag C Si Ti

# 中文说明：无热源、无热浴的短时冷态守恒诊断。
neighbor 2.0 bin
timestep 0.0001
velocity all create 300 20261118 mom yes rot no dist gaussian
fix integrate all nve
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal
run 1000
